        "answer": {
          "short": "$33\\frac{1}{3}\\%$",
          "worked": "Before 8:30 a.m. includes 6:00, 7:00 and 8:00 a.m.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Number before 8:30 a.m.}&=4+8+8\\\\\\text{Number before 8:30 a.m.}&=20\\\\\\text{Total number of boys}&=4+8+8+10+13+17\\\\\\text{Total number of boys}&=60\\\\\\text{Percentage before 8:30 a.m.}&=\\frac{20}{60}\\times100\\%\\\\\\text{Percentage before 8:30 a.m.}&=33\\frac{1}{3}\\%\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
